{"uid":"thag1.93","title":"Eraka","reference":"Theragāthā 1.93","blocks":[{"kind":"verse","lines":["Sensual pleasures are suffering, Eraka!","Sensual pleasures aren’t happiness, Eraka!","One who enjoys sensual pleasures","enjoys suffering, Eraka!","One who doesn’t enjoy sensual pleasures","doesn’t enjoy suffering, Eraka!"]}]}
